    "imperial_victory1_siege_operations_ability_description": "Locks the Victory I into a fixed siege posture while allowing it to turn in place. Increases turbolaser range, improves concussion missile reload speed, and enhances allied missile movement and turning within the gravity well.",
    "imperial_victory1_armor_fracture_debuff_name": "Armor Fracture",
